# Build output and IDE state
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user

# Source control, CI and deployment files are not part of the image
.git/
.github/
.template.config/
deploy/
tests/

# Secrets must never reach the build context
.env
.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/*.pfx

# Files that change often but do not affect the build
**/Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
*.md
